span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Impurto_Nexim\" title=\"Impurto Nexim\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Portrait_Impurto_Nexim.png/25px-Portrait_Impurto_Nexim.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Portrait_Impurto_Nexim.png/38px-Portrait_Impurto_Nexim.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Portrait_Impurto_Nexim.png/50px-Portrait_Impurto_Nexim.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Impurto Nexim\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Portrait_Impurto_Nexim.png/25px-Portrait_Impurto_Nexim.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Portrait_Impurto_Nexim.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Impurto_Nexim\" title=\"Impurto Nexim\">Impurto Nexim</a> on the first floor in <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Jannath%27s_Estate\" title=\"Lady Jannath's Estate\">Lady Jannath's Estate</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-266&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-66</span>, if <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oskar_Fevras\" title=\"Oskar Fevras\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/25px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/38px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/50px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Oskar Fevras\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/25px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oskar_Fevras\" title=\"Oskar Fevras\">Oskar Fevras</a> is not rescued in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>To the Esteemed Lord Nexim,\n</p><p>Please allow me to offer my sincere and heartfelt condolences - to lose both of one's parents in such rapid succession is truly an agony for which there is no balm.\n</p><p><br>\nFortunately, I believe my spirits and I are able to soothe your anxieties with regards to their missing will. When it comes to matters of inheritence, the dead always prove most eager to clarify their intent.\n</p><p><br>\nCome to my mansion at the seafront, and we will see what we can learn. Given the delicacy of this request, I will of course require payment in advance.\n</p><p><br>\nYours in spirit,\n</p><p>Mystic Carrion\n</p><p><br>\nP.S. when called for, \"secreta mortuorum\" will grant you access.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203422\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2358/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 43006/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11617/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1098290/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   51.289      1 -total\n 98.33%   50.430      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n 60.44%   31.000     10 Template:Icon_text\n 53.62%   27.499     24 Template:Trim\n 25.93%   13.301      3 Template:Uid\n 15.84%    8.125      4 Template:Icon_link\